<title>USA: Vanguard Airlines January load factor up.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Airlines January load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Airlines Inc said Tuesday its January load factor gained 10.55 points to 51.82 percent from 41.27 percent in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>It said revenue passenger miles advanced 135.6 percent to 67.2 million from 28.5 million, and available seat miles rose 87.6 percent to 129.7 million from 69.1 million.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
